  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening territorial capacities for the implementation of the Women, Peace and Security agenda in Colombia.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Over an eight-month period, under the leadership of CIASE and in partnership with CONAMIC and the MPS Collective, the project will consolidate and strengthen the political, institutional, territorial, and legal conditions that enable the effective, multi-level implementation of the National Action Plan for Resolution 1325. This will contribute to a transformative shift in how public institutions and feminist movements co-lead the Women, Peace and Security agenda, ensuring its integration into territorial realities, institutional practices, legal frameworks, and international 
advocacy spaces.</narrative>
  </description>
